PhotoVault is a professional App for you to secures photos. This app will NEVER upload your photos to the cloud. And also the local data saved in your device are encrypted by AES. So there is no way to access your photos without your passcode.

Main features:

- Face ID && Touch ID;
- Custom albums;
- Manage photos in album easily;
- Import && export with just one click;
- Beautiful design and easy to use;
- Full-screen viewing photos;
- Local data encrypted;
- Ads free;

More features are coming.

Contact us: x_feedback@hotmail.com

HEIC images batch converter
- allows export to JPEG (with compression ratio setting) and PNG files;
- can use multi-threading (multitasking) for significantly increasing the processing speed;
- can keep or miss metadata;
- processes files locally on your device, so it respects your privacy and security;
- advertising-free;
- without collecting personal data;
- lightweight, based on native technologies;
- has a simple, minimalist interface.
